{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13507","headline":"登栖霞寺塔 · 蒋涣","name":"登栖霞寺塔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三休寻磴道，九折步云霓。\n瀍涧临江北，郊原极海西。\n沙平瓜步出，树远绿杨低。\n南指晴天外，青峯是会稽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蒋涣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13507.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13507","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}